  "gh:content": {
    "en": "Hibiki: “They are completely async. They use the ‘same words,’ but the meanings don’t match. In music terms, it’s like playing two different songs at once.”",
    "ja": "Hibiki「完全に非同期。彼らは\"同じ言葉\"を使ってるけど、その意味が全然違う。音楽で言えば、別の曲を同時に演奏してるみたいだ」"
  },
